tle=\"Serafin\"/><area alt=\"Cascade Towers\" coords=\"301,145,357,201\" href=\"/wiki/Cascade_Towers\" shape=\"rect\" title=\"Cascade Towers\"/><area alt=\"Fortune Wing 1\" coords=\"280,113,339,155\" href=\"/wiki/Fortune_Wing_1\" shape=\"rect\" title=\"Fortune Wing 1\"/><area alt=\"Fortune Wing 2\" coords=\"248,121,274,145\" href=\"/wiki/Fortune_Wing_2\" shape=\"rect\" title=\"Fortune Wing 2\"/><area alt=\"Fortune Wing 3\" coords=\"240,83,282,120\" href=\"/wiki/Fortune_Wing_3\" shape=\"rect\" title=\"Fortune Wing 3\"/><area alt=\"Fortune Wing 4\" coords=\"280,75,301,112\" href=\"/wiki/Fortune_Wing_4\" shape=\"rect\" title=\"Fortune Wing 4\"/><area alt=\"Zarak\" coords=\"3,417,18,435\" href=\"/wiki/Zarak\" shape=\"rect\" title=\"Zarak\"/><area alt=\"Barry\" coords=\"446,75,457,88\" href=\"/wiki/Barry\" shape=\"rect\" title=\"Barry\"/><area alt=\"Julius\" coords=\"299,388,312,403\" href=\"/wiki/Julius\" shape=\"rect\" title=\"Julius\"/></map><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<p><small>Click on the map to go to specific NPCs and buildings.</small>\n</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"item-droppedby-wrapper\" style=\"margin-top:0.5em;\">\n</div>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: small;\">Put your cursor over the map to see where the streets, houses, and NPCs are.</span>\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-street-notes\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Notes\">Notes</span></h3>\n<p>Yalahar is unique amongst cities in that there is only one street that runs throughout the <a href=\"#/wiki/Inner%20City\">Inner City</a> in almost a circular shape.\n</p><p><b>Harbour:</b><br/>\n</p>\n<ul><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Captain%20Cookie\">Captain Cookie</a>, boat deck (second floor)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Guide%20Edna\">Guide Edna</a>, dock (second floor)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Temple\">Temple</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Lorietta\">Lorietta</a>, raft</li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Karith\">Karith</a>, boat helm  (third floor)</li></ul>\n<p><b>Central Yalahar:</b><br/>\n</p>\n<ul><li>Yalahari central building\n<ul><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Palimuth\">Palimuth</a>, entrance</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Yalahari%20%28NPC%29\">Yalahari (NPC)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Golem%20Guardian\">Golem Guardian</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Servant%20Golem\">Servant Golem</a></li></ul></li>\n<li>Game Hall</li></ul>\n<p><b>West side from South to North:</b><br/>\n</p>\n<ul><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Depot\">Depot</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Tibian%20Explorer%20Society\">Tibian Explorer Society</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Timothy\">Timothy</a></li></ul></li>\n<li>Furniture Shop\n<ul><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Dorbin\">Dorbin</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Orc%20Berserker%20%28NPC%29\">Orc Berserker (NPC)</a></li></ul></li>\n<li>Shopping Tower\n<ul><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Oiriz\">Oiriz</a>, Jewelry Shop</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Gree%20Dee\">Gree Dee</a>, General Equipment Shop (second floor)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Chuckles\">Chuckles</a>, Yalahar Magic Shop (third floor)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Vincent\">Vincent</a>, Distance Weapons Shop (fifth floor)</li></ul></li>\n<li>Radiant Plaza 1</li>\n<li>Radiant Plaza 2</li>\n<li>Radiant Plaza 3</li>\n<li>Radiant Plaza 4</li>\n<li>Sun Palace</li>\n<li>Aureate Court 1</li>\n<li>Aureate Court 2</li>\n<li>Aureate Court 3</li>\n<li>Aureate Court 4</li>\n<li>Halls of Serenity</li></ul>\n<p><b>East side from South to North:</b><br/>\n</p>\n<ul><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Food\">Tavern</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Pugwah\">Pugwah</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Menacing%20Mummy\">Menacing Mummy</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Lisander\">Lisander</a></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Food\">\"Delicious Meat and Ham\" Shop</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Soilance\">Soilance</a></li></ul></li>\n<li>Armors and Weapons Shop\n<ul><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Morpel\">Morpel</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/A%20Grumpy%20Cyclops\">A Grumpy Cyclops</a></li></ul></li>\n<li>Bank and Post\n<ul><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Znozel\">Znozel</a>, BanK of ZnoZeL</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Redward\">Redward</a>, Post Office (second floor)</li></ul></li>\n<li>Luminous Arc 1</li>\n<li>Luminous Arc 2</li>\n<li>Luminous Arc 3</li>\n<li>Luminous Arc 4</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Food\">Serafin's heavenly fruits</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Serafin\">Serafin</a></li></ul></li>\n<li>Cascade Towers</li>\n<li>Fortune Wing 1</li>\n<li>Fortune Wing 2</li>\n<li>Fortune Wing 3</li>\n<li>Fortune Wing 4</li></ul>\n<p><br/>\nSome Yalahar buildings and NPCs lie outside the city beyond named streets: (west to east around the <a href=\"#/wiki/Inner%20City\">Inner City</a>)<br/>\n<i>Note: guards are between the quarters</i><br/>\n<a href=\"#/wiki/Foreigner%20Quarter\">Foreigner Quarter</a>:<br/>\n</p>\n<ul><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Maris\">Maris</a>, boat (second floor)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Zarak\">Zarak</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Knight\">Knight Guild</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Tony\">Tony</a>, guard</li></ul>\n<p><a href=\"#/wiki/Arena%20and%20Zoo%20Quarter\">Arena and Zoo Quarter</a>:<br/>\n</p>\n<ul><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Tamerin\">Tamerin</a>, druid</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Hal\">Hal</a>, guard</li></ul>\n<p><a href=\"#/wiki/Alchemist%20Quarter\">Alchemist Quarter</a>:<br/>\n</p>\n<ul><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Bruce\">Bruce</a>, guard</li></ul>\n<p><a href=\"#/wiki/Cemetery%20Quarter\">Cemetery Quarter</a>:<br/>\n</p>\n<ul><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Reed\">Reed</a>, guard</li></ul>\n<p><a href=\"#/wiki/Magician%20Quarter\">Magician Quarter</a><br/>\n</p>\n<ul><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Ethan\">Ethan</a>, Residential Area - <a href=\"#/wiki/Paladin\">Paladin Guild</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Lucius\">Lucius</a>, Residential Area during Lightbearer event</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Ortheus\">Ortheus</a>, Residential Area (second floor)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Tamara\">Tamara</a>, Residential Area - <a href=\"#/wiki/Druid\">Druid Guild</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Tamoril\">Tamoril</a>, Dragon's Hoard island - <a href=\"#/wiki/Sorcerer\">Sorcerer Guild</a>  (third floor)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Barry\">Barry</a>, guard</li></ul>\n<p><a href=\"#/wiki/Sunken%20Quarter\">Sunken Quarter</a>:<br/>\n</p>\n<ul><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Tarak\">Tarak</a>, ferry</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Maritima\">Maritima</a>, mermaid  (underwater)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Oliver\">Oliver</a>, guard</li></ul>\n<p><a href=\"#/wiki/Factory%20Quarter\">Factory Quarter</a>:<br/>\n</p>\n<ul><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Peter\">Peter</a>, guard</li></ul>\n<p><a href=\"#/wiki/Trade%20Quarter\">Trade Quarter</a>:<br/>\n</p>\n<ul><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Armenius\">Armenius</a>, tavern</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Harlow\">Harlow</a>, boat</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Iriana\">Iriana</a>, equipment shop near pass</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Jimmy\">Jimmy</a>, assassin thief (third floor)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Julius\">Julius</a>, near gate</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Mr.%20West\">Mr. West</a>, trade baron (third floor)</li></ul>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div class=\"navigation\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Related_Streets\">Related Streets</span></h3>\n<div class=\"navigation-body\">\n<h4><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Streets_of_Yalahar\">Streets of Yalahar</span></h4>\n<div class=\"navigation-list-wrapper\"><p class=\"no-results\">There are no results matching these parameters.</p></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>","quests":["unnatural-selection-quest"]}